other_moves.detail:
Ali brings it on field data and turn-on, turn-off evidence, not analysis [CX-0009]. The brief carries no field data yet, and we say so.

He will measure:
(1) time on wing: fleet-leader and fleet-average cycles to first shop visit, by aircraft and by environment, with hot and harsh kept separate [CX-0161];
(2) the yardstick: the CFM56 in the same environment, as with LEAP [CX-0006]. The LEAP-1A kit's return to CFM56 parity is the floor (inference) [CX-0209];
(3) unscheduled removals and their causes by part number;
(4) life-limited parts at full life against certified life;
(5) enhanced-inspection findings on safety-critical parts, in new-make shops and in MRO [CX-0010];
(6) every distress turned on in test and turned off by the fix, with root cause and the fix accepted by the airframer and the regulator [CX-0003].

Embraer is measured on its own airframe. GEnx is measured against the baseline GEnx fleet [CX-0169].

Every finding is a cross-functional call [CX-0012]. Any finding that touches both aircraft comes to the Board at once. We fix the part; we don't redesign or cancel the engine [CX-0005]. Fleet support comes before any new spend. If a reserve is needed, Ghai books it in the quarter we find the need.

Ali raises no flag today. That is recorded as 'nothing in front of him', not as a clearance.

CFM narrowbody support is priced jointly with Safran and kept private. The partners split CFM-performed shop visits equally [CX-0184, CX-0219]. GEnx is GE alone.

Ghai's conditions apply:
- no price used to buy back NB share: 'we're not going for share' [CX-0493, CX-0609];
- durability fixes go through reserves and existing service agreements as contracted, not as a commercial giveaway;
- service contracts are modelled conservatively.

This is the installed-base work the game now turns on [CX-0422]. The board already counts this value at delivery, so the work protects the -69.69; it does not add to it.

RISE stays funded inside the R&D we protect first: no cancel for cost (H5) and no 'program dividend' [CX-0174, CX-0398].

Ali's report to the Board, unchanged since last round:
- flight test: not shown on the record;
